WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.876 --> 00:00:03.420
[upbeat music]

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:11.887
[mellow curious music]

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:32.741
Are you there God?
It's me, Margaret.

00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:34.034
[upbeat music]

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:36.745
I'm here to speak to you today
about your changing bodies.

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:39.957
[WOMAN]
The blood is released
through the vagina.

00:00:39.957 --> 00:00:40.791
[upbeat music]

00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:43.502
[MARGARET]
Please, just do this
one thing for me.

00:00:43.502 --> 00:00:46.296
[upbeat music]

00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:48.465
Just let me be normal and
regular like everybody else.

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:51.385
Just please, please, please,
please, please, please, please.

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:58.058
♪ What I feel, I can't say ♪

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:00.310
I've decided I want you
to join my secret club.

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:01.144
[hairspray hissing]

00:01:01.144 --> 00:01:01.979
Ow.

00:01:01.979 --> 00:01:03.313
[hair crackling]

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:05.858
If you wanna be in the
club, then you have to wear--

00:01:05.858 --> 00:01:06.692
A bra.

00:01:08.193 --> 00:01:11.655
Oh, do you think you need one?

00:01:13.448 --> 00:01:15.742
Are you okay?
You can tell me the truth.

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:17.327
- [man screams]
- Fine.

00:01:17.327 --> 00:01:18.495
Good. Yes.

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:21.874
We have the Campus Improvement
Committee, any volunteers?

00:01:21.874 --> 00:01:23.375
Social Committee.
[bell pings]

00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:25.210
Fundraising Committee.
[bell pings]

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:26.712
And how are you?

00:01:26.712 --> 00:01:29.006
I read that when you don't
have any loved ones around

00:01:29.006 --> 00:01:31.341
your life expectancy
drops drastically.

00:01:31.341 --> 00:01:33.468
But you know
I've had a good run.

00:01:33.468 --> 00:01:34.303
[woman sighs]

00:01:34.303 --> 00:01:36.722
[upbeat music]

00:01:40.809 --> 00:01:44.062
♪ Tell me who am I ♪

00:01:44.062 --> 00:01:48.233
It's tiring, trying so hard
all the time, doesn't it?

00:01:48.233 --> 00:01:51.403
♪ By my side ♪

00:01:51.403 --> 00:01:53.030
[JANIE]
I don't know
if I wanna do this.

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:54.323
It's just that we're ready.

00:01:54.323 --> 00:01:55.782
Please God,
let it be a lady.

00:01:59.369 --> 00:02:02.539
[metal creaking]

00:02:02.539 --> 00:02:04.917
[upbeat music]

00:02:06.835 --> 00:02:09.796
Do you think any of us will
look like that when we're 19?

00:02:11.381 --> 00:02:12.966
We must. We must.

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:14.510
We must increase our bust.

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:17.179
[upbeat music]

